.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "September 2026" "BSDSF23M009-OS-A01" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words, and characters in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int wordCount(FILE *" file ", int *" lines ", int *" words ", int *" chars );
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B wordCount()
function reads the given file stream and counts the number of
lines, words, and characters, storing the results in the
.I lines,
.I words,
and
.I chars
pointers respectively.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success, or -1 on failure.
.SH AUTHOR
Written by Alisha (BSDSF23M009).
